# Stock & POS — always apply

Canonical doc: `docs/AGENT_STOCK_POS_FULL_IMPLEMENTATION.md`  
Skill: `.cursor/skills/stock-pos-build/SKILL.md`

## Operating rules

- Modify the existing modular monolith; do not rebuild or split into microservices.
- Keep frontend, backend, DB, permissions, i18n, and tests synchronized.
- Prefer editing existing modules; use safe reversible Alembic migrations.
- Money uses `Decimal` / `NUMERIC` only.

## Forbidden features (remove, do not add)

Delivery Note · standalone UOM · product `uom_id`/Convert UOM UI · minimum stock · expired stock / expiry-only scheduler · customer credit limit · sale `deliveryFee` / `needsDelivery`.

## Allowed field sets

- Product: code, name, barcode, category, brand, purchase/sale price, profit % (calc), stock, image, note, status, timestamps.
- Customer/Supplier: code, name, phone, address, current debt (read-only in CRUD), note, status, timestamps.
- Lines may use height/width/qty → m²; persist calculation snapshots on save.
- Sale totals: `grand_total = subtotal + other_charge - discount` (FE: `otherCharge`).
- Purchase totals: `grand_total = subtotal + other_cost - discount` (FE: `otherCost`).

## Progress snapshot

- Frontend allowlist pages, dimensional POS/purchase UI, and Delivery/UOM/min-stock/expiry/credit-limit **UI removal** are largely done.
- Still open: mock seed purge (`uoms`, `deliveryNotes`), `uom-conversions.ts` cleanup, stale i18n, backend routers/Alembic, deep report/statement exports.

## Atomic writes

Purchase, sale, return, payment, and stock adjustment each run in one DB transaction with stock movements + ledger updates. No partial commits. No silent negative stock.
